that pass Q1-Q6 (well-formed, coherent with the adjacency table, in
character re-checked from the resident's own data, true callbacks re-read
from the sim, safe), the Chao1 estimate, the failure histogram, and the
conversation tier (6-turn bot conversations, distinct when they differ in
